UID:event-echoes-of-the-familiar@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20260930T200000Z
SUMMARY:Echoes of the Familiar
DESCRIPTION:Echoes of the Familiar exhibition explores the concept that home transcends mere physical space\, embodying a tapestry of memories intricately woven into its very walls. It is within these confines that the echoes of laughter from childhood games intermingle with the remnants of disagreements and tears shed upon pillows. Each drawer brims with knick-knacks whose purposes remain elusive yet evoke nostalgia. The scent of maternal cooking and the rhythmic snoring of a father create a comforting ambiance\, while the presence of a grandmother before the television grounds us in familial continuity. These shared experiences resonate universally\, forging a collective nostalgia for "al zaman al Jameel
LOCATION:Ithra - Museum - Gallery 2
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-echoes-of-the-familiar.html
END:VEVENT
