UID:event-alula-trail-race@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20270122T060000Z
DTEND:20270122T150000Z
SUMMARY:AlUla Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Every January\, AlUla bursts into action with the AlUla Trail Race - a dynamic celebration of endurance and unity set against its breathtaking ancient landscape. Whether you’re tackling the ultra-marathon or cheering on the Kids Run\, each course challenges the spirit while weaving through awe-inspiring heritage sites and sandstone wonders. This multi-day event invites runners and supporters alike to come together\, creating memories that blend athletic grit with cultural discovery. Expect vibrant energy\, international camaraderie\, and a festival-like atmosphere the whole family can enjoy.
LOCATION:Across AlUla
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-alula-trail-race.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-alula-tour@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T134409Z
DTSTART:20270126T060000Z
DTEND:20270126T150000Z
SUMMARY:AlUla Tour
DESCRIPTION:AlUla Tour is a major fixture on the international cycling calendar\, attracting the world’s top teams and riders for a multi-stage race through one of the most spectacular landscapes on Earth. From dramatic desert backdrops to iconic landmarks like Maraya and the Oasis\, each stage delivers high performance and unforgettable scenery in equal measure. Individual AlUla Tour stages will be announced closer to the race date\, but previous editions have seen riders traverse routes from Old Town to Harrat Uwayrid and Winter Park to Wirkah Mountain.
LOCATION:Across AlUla
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-alula-tour.html
END:VEVENT
